  "title": "Frosty Strawberry Dessert",
  "description": "Sweetened fresh strawberries and whipped egg whites are frozen over crunchy, buttery walnut crumbs in this easy dessert recipe made in a 9x13-inch dish.",
  "authors": [
    "puppitypup"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:13:51-04:00",
